    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to <strong>4 players online</strong>. Coordinate, explore, and survive together... or die alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Escape System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is unique. Out of 4 possible escape items, <strong>only 2 spawn per run</strong>. No guides. No routines. Just pure tension and unpredictability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6 Possible Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Your actions echo. <br>With <strong>6 distinct endings</strong>, every playthrough offers a new path\u2014and a new consequence. <br>Will you escape, sacrifice, or descend into darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asymmetrical Threat: The Goatman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hunts. He listens. He adapts. <br><strong>one single hit means instant death</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hyper-Realistic Modern Villa</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A luxurious yet unsettling villa, meticulously crafted to trap, confuse, and terrify. <br>Every room tells a story. Every shadow hides a threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for full immersion with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish-eye lens effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic depth of field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle head bobbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen Lumen lighting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every footstep, creak, breath, and distant growl matters. <br><strong>Sound is survival.</strong> Or your death sentence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed for Full Immersion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No HUD. No hints. No second chances. <br>Just you, your flashlight, and the constant ticking of time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Escape Midnight?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: <br>\ud83d\udd0d Search the house <br>\ud83d\udd11 Find the key items <br>\ud83d\udeaa Unlock your way out <br>\ud83d\udc10 Avoid the Goatman <br>\ud83d\udc80 Survive\u2026 or don\u2019t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But escaping\u2026 is just one of the endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Shot. One Chance. Six Endings.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no tutorials. No mercy. No retries. <br>Just <strong>fear, teamwork</strong>, and the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to <strong>4 players online</strong>. Coordinate, explore, and survive together... or die alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Escape System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is unique. Out of 4 possible escape items, <strong>only 2 spawn per run</strong>. No guides. No routines. Just pure tension and unpredictability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6 Possible Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Your actions echo. <br>With <strong>6 distinct endings</strong>, every playthrough offers a new path\u2014and a new consequence. <br>Will you escape, sacrifice, or descend into darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asymmetrical Threat: The Goatman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hunts. He listens. He adapts. <br><strong>one single hit means instant death</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hyper-Realistic Modern Villa</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A luxurious yet unsettling villa, meticulously crafted to trap, confuse, and terrify. <br>Every room tells a story. Every shadow hides a threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for full immersion with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish-eye lens effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic depth of field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle head bobbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen Lumen lighting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every footstep, creak, breath, and distant growl matters. <br><strong>Sound is survival.</strong> Or your death sentence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed for Full Immersion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No HUD. No hints. No second chances. <br>Just you, your flashlight, and the constant ticking of time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Escape Midnight?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: <br>\ud83d\udd0d Search the house <br>\ud83d\udd11 Find the key items <br>\ud83d\udeaa Unlock your way out <br>\ud83d\udc10 Avoid the Goatman <br>\ud83d\udc80 Survive\u2026 or don\u2019t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But escaping\u2026 is just one of the endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Shot. One Chance. Six Endings.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no tutorials. No mercy. No retries. <br>Just <strong>fear, teamwork</strong>, and the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>",
    "short_description": "Midnight escape is a terrifying co-op survival horror game playable solo or with up to 4 players online. Explore a hyper-realistic modern mansion, search for escape items, and avoid a monstrous predator that hunts without mercy.",
